-- nk-probe-p: a probe of the checker, to be removed (part of machine-in-hyperactive)
nk-probe-p : (sl : NkSlots) (u1 n1 u2 n2 : Word) → nk-apart u2 (nk-plan-fx sl u1 n1) → nk-apart (nk-rw (nk-get sl u2) u2) (nk-plan-fx sl u1 n1) → (x : Word) → nk-get (nk-step-at u2 n2 (nk-step-at u1 n1 sl)) x ≡ nk-get (nk-do (nk-plan-fx sl u2 n2) (nk-step-at u1 n1 sl)) x
nk-probe-p sl u1 n1 u2 n2 b1 b2 x = nk-step-as-do sl u2 n2 (nk-plan-fx sl u1 n1) b1 b2 x
